      "name": "domain_name",
      "options": [
        "--domain-name"
      ],
      "raw_name": "DomainName",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "true",
      "help_en": "Specifies whether to return detailed attributes of the domain name. Valid values:\n\ntrue\n\nfalse\n\nThe default value is false.\n\nIf you set this parameter to true, the response includes the following parameters: lineType, minTtl, recordLineTreeJson, recordLines, lineCode, lineDisplayName, lineName, regionLines, and slaveDns",
      "help_zh": "是否返回域名详细的属性，取值范围：\ntrue：\nfalse \n\n默认值：false，不需要细节属性。\n\n当值为true时，则返回以下数据：lineType、minTtl、recordLineTreeJson、recordLines、lineCode、lineDisplayName、lineName、regionLines、slaveDns",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "need_detail_attributes",
      "options": [
        "--need-detail-attributes"
      ],
      "raw_name": "NeedDetailAttributes",
      "required": false,
      "type": "bool"
    }
  ],
  "pathPattern": "",
